ers\",\"magnetic\":false,\"doubleSided\":false,\"boardType\":\"n/a\",\"surfaceKind\":\"pin-up\",\"usage\":\"Classrooms, coaching centres and offices\",\"blurb\":\"Deluxe Standard Notice Board: Super Fine Velvet Cloth · Deluxe anodized aluminium frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Deluxe Standard Notice Board uses standard quality materials with Electroplated Chrome Corners. A Super Fine Velvet Cloth surface handles everyday pin usage over a soft core suited to normal pinning.\\n\\nIt is reliable for daily use. Available colours: Red, Blue, Maroon and Green.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Material — Standard quality materials with Electroplated Chrome Corners\",\"Surface — Super Fine Velvet Cloth for everyday pin usage\",\"Core — Soft core suitable for normal pin use\",\"Durability — Reliable for daily use\",\"Colours — Red, Blue, Maroon, Green\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[\"$22:0:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:props:asset\"],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"deluxe-standard-notice-board--3-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"deluxe-standard-notice-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-DS-NOT-3X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"3-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"3 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":91},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":2580,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"deluxe-standard-notice-board--4-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"deluxe-standard-notice-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-DS-NOT-4X4FT0\",