ice Board: Super Fine Velvet Cloth · Lightweight ribbed aluminium anodized frame. Made to order in the sizes listed here; confirm the exact specification with Plusmark before dispatch.\",\"description\":\"The Eco Regular Notice Board uses economical materials with standard plastic corners. A Super Fine Velvet Cloth surface covers basic pin-up needs over a soft core for light pin usage.\\n\\nIt is best for home classrooms, tuition classes and small offices, and suits light, occasional use. Available colours: Red, Blue, Maroon and Green.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 1 x 1 ft, 2 x 2 ft, 2 x 3 ft, 2 x 4 ft, 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Material — Economical materials with standard plastic corners\",\"Surface — Super Fine Velvet Cloth for basic pin-up needs\",\"Core — Soft core for light pin usage\",\"Durability — Suitable for light and occasional use\",\"Colours — Red, Blue, Maroon, Green\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[],\"videoId\":null,\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"eco-regular-notice-board--1-x-1-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-regular-notice-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-ER-NOT-1X1FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"1-x-1-ft\",\"label\":\"1 x 1 ft\",\"widthCm\":30,\"heightCm\":30},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":580,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"eco-regular-notice-board--2-x-2-ft\",\"productId\":\"eco-regular-notice-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-ER-NOT-2X2FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"2-x-2-ft\",\"label\":\"2 x 2 ft\",\"widthCm\":61,\"heightCm\":61},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":970,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\"