ium aluminium construction with Signature Dual-Tone Corners. A 2 mm Blazer Cloth surface holds colour for the long term over a soft, pin-friendly core made for frequent and heavy pin usage.\\n\\nIt is the highest grade of the range, designed for long-term institutional use. Available colours: Royal & Navy Blue, Almond & Dark Green, Red, Maroon, Light Gray and Dark Gray.\\n\\nStandard sizes on this page are 3 x 4 ft, 4 x 4 ft, 5 x 4 ft, 6 x 4 ft, 8 x 4 ft. Larger or non-standard sizes are made to order — send the size you need and the team will quote it.\\n\\nPrices depend on series, size and quantity, so Plusmark confirms the figure for your exact requirement instead of publishing a list price. There is no minimum order — a single board can go straight in the cart.\",\"features\":[\"Material — Premium aluminium construction with Signature Dual-Tone Corners\",\"Surface — 2 mm Blazer Cloth with long-lasting colour retention\",\"Core — Soft pin-friendly core for frequent and heavy pin usage\",\"Durability — Highest grade, designed for long-term institutional use\",\"Colours — Royal & Navy Blue, Almond & Dark Green, Red, Maroon, Light Gray, Dark Gray\"],\"customisation\":null,\"media\":[{\"publicId\":\"plusmark/products/metallic-premium-notice-board\",\"alt\":\"Metallic Premium Notice Board - Metallic Premium Notice Board by Plusmark\",\"width\":1400,\"height\":1400,\"source\":\"product\"}],\"videoId\":\"plusmark/videos/metallic-premium-notice-board\",\"variants\":[{\"id\":\"metallic-premium-notice-board--3-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"metallic-premium-notice-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-MP-NOT-3X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"3-x-4-ft\",\"label\":\"3 x 4 ft\",\"widthCm\":122,\"heightCm\":91},\"priceMode\":\"fixed\",\"priceInr\":4020,\"compareAtInr\":null,\"stock\":null,\"trackInventory\":false,\"available\":true,\"leadTimeDays\":null},{\"id\":\"metallic-premium-notice-board--4-x-4-ft\",\"productId\":\"metallic-premium-notice-board\",\"sku\":\"PM-MP-NOT-4X4FT0\",\"size\":{\"id\":\"4-x-4